# Place model_with_visemes.glb in this directory
# The GLB file should be a Ready Player Me-style avatar with:
# - Full ARKit blendshapes (66 morph targets on AvatarHead mesh)
# - Oculus viseme set (viseme_sil, viseme_PP, viseme_FF, etc.)
# - LeftEye and RightEye bones for gaze tracking
# 
# After placing the file, run: npm run optimize-avatar
# This creates model_with_visemes_optimized.glb with Draco compression
